    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained three-bedroom semi-detached residence in a peaceful village setting, located just minutes from Castlegregory Village.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and spacious throughout and comprises an open plan living and dining area, kitchen, and three generously proportioned bedrooms, each benefiting from its own ensuite bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys a sunny paved rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining, together with off-street parking to the front.\n\nConveniently located close to all local amenities, Castlegregory Village offers a wide range of services including shops, schools, cafés and sporting facilities. The recently developed secondary school, located adjacent to Caher Square, together with the village primary school and supermarket, are all within easy reach.\n\nThis property will appeal to a variety of purchasers including first-time buyers or investors looking for a property in a desirable coastal location."
      }
